<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Swiss stocks.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Swiss stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein AG has issued one million American-style call warrants each on shares of Novartis AG and Nestle SA, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> PAYMENT DATE    18.MAR.97		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES				    * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT    STRIKE     ISSUE    PREMIUM    GEARING     MATURITY</p>
<p>NOVARTIS (SPOT REF 1,757 CHF)</p>
<p>		1,800 CHF  4.50 DEM 13.5 PCT   9.1 TIMES   19.MAR.99</p>
<p>NESTLE (SPOT REF 1,630 CHF)</p>
<p>		1,625 CHF  6.35 DEM  6.4 PCT  14.91 TIMES  06.FEB.98</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
